** INTERACTION PROPERTIES: frictionless hard contact, direct (Lagrange) enforcement
**
*Surface Interaction, name=HARD
*Surface Behavior, DIRECT, pressure-overclosure=HARD
**
** ---- CONTACT PAIRS ----
** C-section, L-beam leg, sleeve and support plate bear on the concrete top; concrete bottom on the timber
*Contact Pair, interaction=HARD, type=SURFACE TO SURFACE
steel-1.c_bottom, concrete-1.concrete_top
*Contact Pair, interaction=HARD, type=SURFACE TO SURFACE
steel-1.l_bottom, concrete-1.concrete_top
*Contact Pair, interaction=HARD, type=SURFACE TO SURFACE
steel-1.sleeve_bottom, concrete-1.concrete_top
*Contact Pair, interaction=HARD, type=SURFACE TO SURFACE
steel-1.plate_bottom, concrete-1.concrete_top
** vertical part of the support: 10 thick plate against the free-edge face (50 x 50, aligned with the timber)
*Contact Pair, interaction=HARD, type=SURFACE TO SURFACE
steel-1.hplate_face, concrete-1.front_support
*Contact Pair, interaction=HARD, type=SURFACE TO SURFACE
steel-1.timber_top, concrete-1.concrete_bottom
** sleeve (tied to the anchor) against the hole of the C web: contact with pressure-overclosure
** adjust removes the small faceting gap/overlap between the two circles of radius 25
*Contact Pair, interaction=HARD, type=SURFACE TO SURFACE, adjust=0.2
steel-1.sleeve_outer, steel-1.c_hole
**
** BOUNDARY CONDITIONS
**
** back face of the concrete: vertical support ("continuity of the slab")
*Boundary
concrete-1.back_support, 2, 2
** symmetry plane z = 0
*Boundary
steel-1.z_symm, zSYMM
concrete-1.z_symm, zSYMM
** rigid support plates 50 x 50 x 10 (top plate = vertical support, front plate = horizontal support) and timber fixed to the ground
*Boundary
steel-1.plate_all, ENCASTRE
steel-1.hplate_all, ENCASTRE
steel-1.timber_bottom, ENCASTRE
** back end of the L-beam (clamps): vertical and z fixed, free along the pull direction so that the load passes through the C and the anchor
*Boundary
steel-1.l_back, 2, 3
**
** STEP: loading
**
*Step, name=loading, nlgeom=no, inc=100000
*Static
5e-4, 1, 1e-08, 5e-3
**
** Name: load Type: Displacement (end of the L-beam, 100 beyond the free edge; jack keeps uy = uz = 0)
*Boundary, type=displacement
steel-1.load_end, 1, 1, 5.0
steel-1.load_end, 2, 3, 0.0
