*Print, contact=yes
*Restart, write, frequency=1, overlay
*Include, input="./incfiles/output.inc"
*Include, input="./incfiles/fileOutput.inc"
*Output, history, frequency=1
*Node Output, nset=steel-1.load_end
RF1, U1
*End Step
